 "description": "Create a watch on an address. Returns a wallet snapshot and watchId; use watch-diff later to receive only changed fields. Use to create the first address snapshot in a stateful watch workflow. Save the returned watchId and call monitor.watch.diff in the same MCP session for later changes.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
