    "description": "Wallet address to watch (EVM 0x... or Solana base58)",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "chain": {
    "default": "base",
    "description": "Blockchain to query. EVM chains: base, ethereum, arbitrum, optimism, polygon, bsc, avalanche, zksync, linea, scroll, blast, mantle, gnosis, polygon-zkevm, mode, sei, celo, manta, taiko, fantom, cronos, opbnb, zora, worldchain, metis, fraxtal, kava, zetachain, filecoin, core-dao, aurora, moonbeam, klaytn, bob, canto, monad, tempo, megaeth, arc, plasma, katana, robinhood, pharos, hyperevm. Dedicated non-EVM adapters: solana, hyperliquid, canton.",
